# T0-A / 2026-08-26 / Python 3.11+ / macOS arm64 candidate.
#
# The official MOSS-TTS-Nano source revision cc7bdf19 pins torch/torchaudio
# and transformers but leaves most other packages open.  This input closes
# those ranges for a reproducible Stage 0 environment.  WeTextProcessing is
# intentionally absent: its required pynini 2.1.6.post1 has no macOS arm64
# wheel on PyPI.  Stage 0 must run with WeText disabled until a separately
# reviewed conda-forge or source-build path is approved.
